            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Breathe Better, Sleep Deeper, Wake Up Glowing</strong></h4><p></p><p>Your skincare routine doesn’t stop at serums and moisturizers — it begins with the air you breathe. The Blueair Air Purifier + Humidifier 2-in-1 Pro is a revolutionary all-in-one device designed to elevate your air quality and your skin health, night after night. </p><p></p><p>This isn’t just a humidifier. Or just a purifier. It’s both — working in perfect harmony to create a cleaner, more comfortable indoor environment that supports deeper sleep and radiant skin. Think of it as your invisible skincare partner. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
