            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>The First Air Device Co-Developed with Dermatologists</strong> </h4><p> </p><p>At the heart of the 2-in-1 Pro is DermaSense™ Skin Mode — a smart hydration setting co-developed with board-certified dermatologists. While you sleep, it gently humidifies the air to help prevent overnight moisture loss, protect your skin barrier, and enhance your natural glow. </p><p>Users report waking up with softer, healthier-looking skin and even improvements in their overall nighttime skincare routine — without changing a single product. </p><p> </p><h4><strong>Clean Air + Clean Humidity = Whole-Home and Human Wellness</strong> </h4><p> </p><p>Most humidifiers and air purifiers do one job. The 2-in-1 Pro does both — and it does them better together. </p><ul><li>13% faster air purification using Blueair’s signature HEPASilent™ technology </li><li>Removes 99.97% of airborne particles like dust, pollen, bacteria, and viruses* </li><li>2X cleaner humidification with 360° InvisibleMist™ — no visible mist, no white dust </li><li>Humidifies rooms up to 1720 sq ft, quietly and evenly </li></ul><p></p><p><em>*Tested on PM2.5 and common allergens in 60 minutes. Blueair does not claim to prevent transmission of airborne illnesses.</em>  </p><p> </p><h4><strong>Beauty Sleep, Simplified</strong> </h4><p> </p><p>Designed for easy, everyday use, the 2-in-1 Pro blends high-tech performance with thoughtful simplicity: </p><ul><li>Top-fill or bucket-fill options for hassle-free refills </li><li>Dishwasher-safe water tank and machine-washable wick filter </li><li>Up to 48 hours of hydration from a single 5L tank </li><li>Built-in UV water pump helps reduce bacterial growth in standing water </li><li>Night Mode drops noise to a whisper-quiet 20dBA for uninterrupted sleep </li></ul><p></p><p>Control everything from your phone with the Blueair app — from humidity levels to wick drying speed, even mood lighting. </p><p> </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
