            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Compact Design, Big Impact</strong> </h4><p> </p><p>With a 43% smaller footprint than the previous generation, the 2-in-1 Pro fits beautifully into any room. Smart sensors and LED indicators keep you updated on filter changes, water levels, and performance, while the Water Refresher module helps reduce mineral buildup to keep water fresh and your air cleaner, longer. </p><p> </p><h4><strong>One Device. Triple Impact.</strong> </h4><p> </p><p>Purify. Hydrate. Glow. </p><p>Discover the Blueair Air Purifier + Humidifier 2-in-1 Pro — the smarter way to breathe easier, sleep better, and wake up glowing. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
